# Archived material

Nothing in this folder is the active theorem-state source.

- [erdos_problem_99_1.7.0-full.md](erdos_problem_99_1.7.0-full.md) is the complete
  pre-reorganization v1.7 report, retained for exact comparison and provenance.
- [erdos_problem_99_complete_working_report.md](erdos_problem_99_complete_working_report.md)
  is an earlier non-canonical working report.
- [homelab_audit_history_v1.7.0.md](homelab_audit_history_v1.7.0.md) is a condensed
  audit-history snapshot recovered during the reorganization.

When an archived file conflicts with the current modules, the [current documentation
map](../README.md) controls.
